    "id": "general",
    "kind": "text",
    "raw": "Let x be real. If 0 ≤ x, abs x = x by abs_of_nonneg. If x < 0, abs x = -x by abs_of_neg. Split these exhaustive cases; substituting the corresponding equality and squaring gives (abs x)^2=x^2.",
